WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Hlanganisa misava ya le henhla leyi humaka etindhawini to hlayanyana ta mubhedhi. Susa maribye, timitsu na matluka.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Tata xiphemu xin’we eka swinharhu swa xibya hi misava. Engetela mati ni sepe yo hlantswa swibya. Pfala, tsekatsekisa, kutani u veka xibya ehansi.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Endzhaku ka minete yin’we, sava ri tshamile ehansi. Funga ehenhla ka xiyenge lexi.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Endzhaku ka tiawara timbirhi, funga ehenhla ka xiyenge lexi landzelaka. I ndhaka.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Kamba endzhaku ka siku rin’we kumbe masiku mambirhi. Loko mati ma voninga ngopfu, funga xiyenge xa vumba. Lexi phaphamalaka i organic matter.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Ringanisa ku leha ka xiyenge xin’wana na xin’wana na ku leha hinkwako ka misava leyi tshameke ehansi ka xibya.
